      "claim": "A trait that makes humans unique must be a capability that no other animal possesses in the full sense of the capability.",
      "evidence": "In comparative cognition, uniqueness is defined by the absence of an equivalent ability in any other species (e.g., Noam Chomsky’s concept of a language‑faculty unique to Homo sapiens).",
